      'The Most Modern POS & Inventory Platform for Your Business': '为您的企业打造的最现代化POS与库存平台',
      'The all-in-one cloud POS, smart inventory, dining table KOT, and automated financial ledgers platform built for fast-moving retail stores, supermarkets, and restaurants.': '为高流转零售店、超市和餐厅打造的一体化云端POS、智能库存、餐桌厨房订单和自动化财务账本平台。',
      'The bar floats as an overlay above the UI, enabling free drag-and-drop placement anywhere across the viewport without altering page grid layout.': '工具栏以浮层形式展示在界面上方，支持在可视区域内自由拖拽定位，不影响页面原有的网格排版。',
