      'Unify your online storefront, barcode checkout, multi-warehouse stock, and WhatsApp invoicing into one lightning-fast cloud POS. Built to turn internet visitors into repeat buyers and keep counters ringing up sales even offline.': '将您的在线店面、条形码结帐、多仓库库存和 WhatsApp 发票统一到一个闪电般快速的云 POS 中。旨在将互联网访问者转变为回头客，并使柜台即使在线下也能保持销售量。',
