      'Watch Tour & Architecture Video': '观看游览和建筑视频',
      'We exist to empower online merchants, retailers, and food businesses with enterprise-grade commerce infrastructure without enterprise complexity or exorbitant fees. By uniting your online storefront, front-counter barcode checkout, multi-warehouse inventory, and automated tax invoicing into one synchronized engine, we remove software friction so you can focus on what matters: acquiring customers, expanding your catalog, and scaling your profit.': '我们的存在是为了为在线商家、零售商和食品企业提供企业级商务基础设施，而无需企业复杂性或高昂的费用。通过将您的在线店面、前台条形码结帐、多仓库库存和自动税务发票整合到一个同步引擎中，我们消除了软件摩擦，以便您可以专注于重要的事情：获取客户、扩展产品目录和扩大利润。',
      'We run 6 restaurant and bakery outlets. Having table QR ordering, instant KOT kitchen display routing, and automated WhatsApp receipts in one system transformed our bottom line.': '我们经营 6 家餐厅和面包店。在一个系统中整合餐桌二维码点餐、即时 KOT 厨房显示路由和自动 WhatsApp 收据，改变了我们的利润。',
      'Web, Desktop': '网络、桌面',
      'Which hardware devices and printers are supported?': '支持哪些硬件收银设备、条码枪与小票打印机？',
      'Why Modern Online Stores & Retailers Choose Our Platform': '为什么现代在线商店和零售商选择我们的平台',
      'Windows': '窗户',
      'Windows, macOS & Linux Ready': 'Windows、macOS 和 Linux 就绪',
