      'Switching to this platform doubled our online order throughput while cutting counter checkout times in half. The live inventory sync between our web store and physical shops prevented overselling completely.': 'Beralih ke platform ini menggandakan hasil pesanan online kami sekaligus memotong setengah waktu pembayaran di konter. Sinkronisasi inventaris langsung antara toko web kami dan toko fisik mencegah penjualan berlebih sepenuhnya.',
      'Synchronize inventory across your online store, physical shops, and central warehouses in real time. Automatic low-stock triggers prevent embarrassing stockouts.': 'Sinkronkan inventaris di toko online, toko fisik, dan gudang pusat Anda secara real time. Pemicu stok rendah otomatis mencegah kehabisan stok yang memalukan.',
